{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "header",
      "content": {
        "json": "# APIM Gateway Validation\nGateway-side health for the APIM instance fronting the PTU deployments, with an optional PTU usage section (Utilization V2, Active Tokens, 429s, Time to Response, Tokens Per Second) pulled in from the Foundry/Azure OpenAI resource. Every chart is a single metric at **1-minute grain**.\n\n**How to use:** pick the APIM instance (required) and, to correlate with PTU exhaustion, the Foundry/Azure OpenAI resource behind it (optional). Drag across any chart to zoom all charts to that window; re-select the time range to reset."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "name": "parameters",
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 1,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "p-resource",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Resource",
            "label": "APIM instance",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.apimanagement/service'\n| project id, name\n| order by name asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-aoai-resource",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "AoaiResource",
            "label": "Foundry / Azure OpenAI resource (optional - for PTU correlation)",
            "type": 5,
            "isRequired": false,
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts'\n| where kind in~ ('OpenAI', 'AIServices')\n| project id, name\n| order by name asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          },
          {
            "id": "p-time",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 3600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 14400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 43200000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 86400000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 259200000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "name": "ptu-usage-header",
      "content": {
        "json": "## PTU usage (Azure OpenAI / Foundry)\nAPIM's own metrics cannot show PTU utilization - that signal only exists on the Foundry/Azure OpenAI resource. Pick it in the **Foundry / Azure OpenAI resource** picker above to render the actual PTU exhaustion charts (Utilization V2, Active Tokens, 429s) and two performance charts (Time to Response, Tokens Per Second) on the same page as the gateway charts below. Leave that picker empty to hide this section."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 10,
      "name": "ptu-utilization-max",
      "content": {
        "chartId": "ptu-utilization-max",
        "version": "MetricsItem/2.0",
        "size": 0,
        "chartType": 2,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
        "metricScope": 0,
        "resourceIds": [
          "{AoaiResource}"
        ],
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 86400000
        },
        "timeGrain": "PT1M",
        "metrics": [
          {
            "namespace": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts",
            "metric": "microsoft.cognitiveservices/accounts-Azure OpenAI  Usage-AzureOpenAIProvisionedManagedUtilizationV2",
            "aggregation": 3,
            "splitBy": [
              "ModelDeploymentName"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "title": "Provisioned-managed Utilization V2 (Max) by deployment",
        "timeBrushParameterName": "TimeRange",
        "showOpenInMe": true,
        "gridSettings": {
          "rowLimit": 10000
        }
      },
      "customWidth": "50",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "AoaiResource",
        "comparison": "isNotEqualTo",
        "value": ""
      }
    },
